<title>UK: INSIGHT -Notionnel trapped, downside beckons.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT -Notionnel trapped, downside beckons.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>June notionnel futures traded on MATIF were expected to be rangebound on Friday with fundamental factors taking centre stage, technical analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;Everyone is awaiting the result of the (French) election on Sunday,&quot; siad Jim Dodgin, senior technical analyst at Technical Data in London.</p>
<p>&quot;From a technical perspective there is a slight downside bias but being realistic I don't really see it going anywhere. Today we will be rangebound in a band between 127.90 and 128.34.&quot;</p>
<p>At 0756 GMT, June notionnel futures were at 128.20, up 0.06.</p>
